OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrests after woman dies
OL,4,Afollowing crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fwoman, aged in her late teens, died
OL,8,Ffollowing a crash, police have said.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said the crash
OL,11,Fhappened on Bloxham Road in Banbury,
OL,12,FOxfordshire, at about 21:20 BST on
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FThe woman's family was being supported
OL,16,Fby specially trained offices, said the
OL,17,Fforce.
OL,19,FThe three arrested people were all from
OL,20,FBanbury, it confirmed, adding that an
OL,21,Finvestigation was continuing.
